00:04:18.403 --> 00:04:19.920
- And that is just--
- Grass?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.633
- Sort of, partially digested.

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:26.350
And the fluid in this,
again, is dripping--

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:29.860
- No! He's gonna drink the
gastric juices of a camel?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:31.513
No. Come on.

00:04:32.362 --> 00:04:34.500
Oh, my God!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:36.203
Bear Grylls is the type of guy,

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:40.190
five million years ago,
to see a cow udder,

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.356
